{"strongs": "H3332", "word": "יָצַק", "translit": "ya.tsaq", "root": "יער", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "pour, cast, flow", "definition": "יָצַק verb pour, cast, flow (Talmud id. ) — Qal Perfect יְצַק Lev 8:15 + 2 t.; וְיָצַק consecutive Lev 2:1 ; Lev 14:15 suffix יְצָקָם 1Kgs 7:46 ; 2Chr 4:17 , etc.; Imperfect יִצֹּק Lev 14:26 ; Num 5:15 וַיִּצֹּק Gen 28:18 + 8 t.; וַּ֫יִּצֶק 1Kgs 22:35 (intransitive sense); 3 feminine singular וַתִּצֹּק 2Sam 13:9 אֶצֹק Isa 44:3 אֶצָּקֿ v Isa 44:3 וַיִּצְקוּ 2Kgs 4:40 Imperative יְצֹק Ezek 24:3 צַק 2Kgs 4:41 יִצְקוּ 1Kgs 18:34 Infinitive צֶ֫קֶת Exod 38:27 ; Job 38:38 Participle Pass. יָצוּק Job 28:2 + 5 t.; plural יְצוּקִים 2Chr 4:3 יְצֻקִים 1Kgs 7:24 יְצֻקוֺת v 1Kgs 7:30 — 1. pour, pour out , oil, in anointing, followed by accusative ( שׁמן ) + על Gen 28:18 ( E ), Gen 35:14 ( J ); followed by מִשֶּׁמֶן + לְ Lev 8:12 ( P ); followed by על ( שׁמן implied from context) Exod 29:7 ( P ), 1Sam 10:1 ; 2Kgs 9:3 followed by שֶׁמֶן + אֶלֿ v 2Kgs 9:6 figurative, with רוּחִי + על Isa 44:3 oil in sacrifice, + על Lev 2:1 ; Lev 2:6 ; Num 5:15 in cleansing, + על Lev 14:15 ; Lev 14:26 (upon his plam; all P ); oil into ( על ) vessels 2Kgs 4:4 water, for washing, + על 2Kgs 3:11 for drenching, + על 1Kgs 18:34 for boiling (into ( בְּ ) the caldron), symbolic, Ezek 24:3 ; Ezek 24:3 for satisfying thirst (figurative) + על Isa 44:3 blood (of sacrifice) + אֶליְֿסוֺד Lev 8:15 ; Lev 9:9 ( P ); pottage, for eating, 2Kgs 4:40 ; 2Kgs 4:41 cakes ( לְבִבוֺת ) 2Sam 13:9 figurative of disease יָצוּק בּוֺ Ps 41:9 infused into him (al. less probably as 3 molten , i.e. fixed upon ). 2. cast (objects of metal) Exod 25:12 ; Exod 26:37 ; Exod 36:36 ; Exod 37:3 ; Exod 37:13 ; Exod 38:5 ; Exod 38:27 (all P ), 1Kgs 7:46 = 2Chr 4:17 ; 1Kgs 7:24 ; 1Kgs 7:30 ; 2Chr 4:3 . 3. Passive participle as adjective figurative cast, hard , of crocodile's scales Job 41:15 of crocodile's heart v. Job 41:16 v. Job 41:16 (as stone). 4. intransitive flow, pour , only וַיִּ֫צֶק 1Kgs 22:35 (of blood), Job 38:38 בְּצֶקֶת עָפָר לַמּוּצָק Hiph`il Imperfect וַיַּצִּ֫קוּ 2Sam 15:24 וַיַּצִּקֻם Josh 7:23 Participle f. מֹי֯צָ֑קֶת 2Kgs 4:5 — pour (oil) 2Kgs 4:5 , figurative of shekels of silver, etc., pour out Josh 7:23 of the ark, 2Sam 15:24 set down (?); but read וַיַצִּיגוּ ( Dr Gr ). Hoph`al Perfect הוּצַק Ps 45:3 Imperfect יוּצַק Lev 21:10 ; Job 22:16 Participle מוּצָ֑ק 1Kgs 7:23 ; 1Kgs 7:33 ; 2Chr 4:2 ; Job 37:18 מֻצָק Job 11:15 construct מֻצַּק 1Kgs 7:16 — 1. be poured , subject שֶׁמֶן followed by לְ (in anointing), Lev 21:10 ( H ); figurative of foundation of wicked Job 22:16 , see Di ; of grace חֵן on lips, Ps 45:3 (followed by ב ), see Che . 2. Participle = cast, molten ׳ הים המ 1Kgs 7:23 = 2Chr 4:2 as predicate 1Kgs 7:33 construct as substantive מֻצַּק נְחשֶׁת 1Kgs 7:16 . 3. Participle , figurative firmly established , predicate of person, ׳ וְהָיִיתָ מ Job 11:15 and thou shalt be established (|| לֹא תִירָא ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3671')\">BDB3671</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H3332')\">H3332</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3670')\">BDB3670</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3672')\">BDB3672</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>יָצַק</bdbheb> <b>verb</b> <highlightword>pour, cast, flow</highlightword> (Talmud <highlight>id.</highlight>) — <div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> <bdbheb>יְצַק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 8:15\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(3,8,15)\">Lev 8:15</ref>+ 2 t.; <bdbheb>וְיָצַק</bdbheb> consecutive <ref ref=\"Lev 2:1\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(3,2,1)\">Lev 2:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 14:15\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(3,14,15)\">Lev 14:15</ref> suffix <bdbheb>יְצָקָם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:46\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"46\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"46\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,46)\">1Kgs 7:46</r